# Fill in your own free-tier Gemini API key from https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# This file must exist for the app to build (flutter_dotenv is bundled as an
# asset), but the key itself is read locally and never committed if you're
# using git — see .gitignore. Leave the value blank to run with AI features
# disabled (photo meal estimates and the weekly AI review will silently be
# unavailable; everything else works exactly the same).
GEMINI_API_KEY=
